//! table, and the restore class, payload family, tier and key-range tiers the restore table, the
//! payload registry and the tier classifier gave it before each row carried its own. Written once by
//! a script from the tree before the change and never regenerated: `assert_snapshot` pins at compile
//! time that the build script's catalogue still equals it. Slice 1's last change removes it, so a new
//! table edits only its owner's `tables.rs`.

